{
  "$comment": [
    "mcharness -- plantilla de settings de PROYECTO (.claude/settings.json).",
    "Dos sensores. El de UserPromptSubmit es el que hace que el harness entre SOLO:",
    "inyecta contexto por stdout plano (contrato verificado en code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks:",
    "UserPromptSubmit y SessionStart anaden su stdout plano al contexto del modelo).",
    "NUNCA exit 2 en UserPromptSubmit: la doc dice que borra el prompt del usuario.",
    "La capa de guards heredada vive en kit/claude/settings.json y se instala aparte.",
    "Cero rutas absolutas: todo cuelga de $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR. Timeouts <=5 s, medidos <60 ms."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(make test)",
      "Bash(make help)",
      "Bash(shellcheck *)",
      "Bash(git status)",
      "Bash(git diff *)",
      "Bash(git log *)",
      "Read(//tmp/**)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm -rf /*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf ~/*)",
      "Bash(rm -rf /)",
      "Bash(git push --force *)",
      "Bash(git push -f *)",
      "Bash(git push -f* *)",
      "Bash(git push -*f *)",
      "Bash(git push * --force)",
      "Bash(git push * -f)",
      "Bash(git push * -f*)",
      "Bash(git push * -*f)",
      "Bash(curl * | bash)",
      "Bash(curl * | sh)",
      "Bash(wget * | bash)",
      "Bash(wget * | sh)",
      "Bash(chmod -R 777 *)",
      "Read(//home/*/.ssh/**)",
      "Read(//home/*/.aws/**)",
      "Read(**/.env)",
      "Read(**/.env.*)",
      "Read(**/secrets.*)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(git push *)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge *)",
      "Bash(gh release *)",
      "Edit(**/settings.json)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/auto-spec.sh",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/verify-gate.sh",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
